\n\t</div>\n        <div class=\"banner-layers container\">\n            <div class=\"fill banner-link\"></div>            \n   <div id=\"text-box-1540983006\" class=\"text-box banner-layer x50 md-x50 lg-x50 y30 md-y30 lg-y30 res-text\">\n                                <div class=\"text-box-content text dark\">\n              \n              <div class=\"text-inner text-center\">\n                  \n\t<div id=\"text-1222119943\" class=\"text\">\n\t\t\n<h2 class=\"uppercase\"><span style=\"font-size: 140%;\"><strong>Tại AVA</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 200%;\">Chúng tôi không chỉ kiến tạo những công trình bền vững, mà còn nuôi dưỡng cả những con người nhiệt huyết !</span><br>\n\t\t\n\n\t</p></div>\n\t\n              </div>\n           </div>\n                            \n\n    </div>\n \n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n            \n\n  </div>\n\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t</section>\n\t\n<div class=\"is-divider divider clearfix\"></div>\n\n\t<section class=\"section\" id=\"section_1869708807\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section-bg fill\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"section-content relative\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"row-748487916\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-871723104\" class=\"col small-12 large-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"container section-title-container\"><h4 class=\"section-title section-title-center\"><b></b><span class=\"section-title-main\">CON NGƯỜI AVA</span><b></b></h4></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"row-639690791\">\n\n\t<div id=\"col-737203852\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"icon-box featured-box icon-box-top text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-img\" style=\"width: 50px\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"47\" height=\"29\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/01.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"01\" title=\"Về AVA Architects 18\">\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-text last-reset\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<h5><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Kỷ luật</span><!-- notionvc: ce712d8d-3a61-4940-b53e-3cd1d329c097 --></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hoạt động dựa trên nguyên tắc thời gian, sự tập trung và mục tiêu. Đảm bảo tính chính xác và hiệu quả trong công việc.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1206591420\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"icon-box featured-box icon-box-top text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-img\" style=\"width: 57px\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"90\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/02-2.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"02 2\" title=\"Về AVA Architects 19\">\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-text last-reset\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<h5><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Cam kết &amp; Trách nhiệm</span><!-- notionvc: 8efa80b0-665d-4a27-8891-1d868f5bfbfc --></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Làm việc dựa trên cam kết và sẵn sàng nhận trách nhiệm với những gì đã làm. Song song là thành quả xứng đáng với kết quả.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-671325365\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"icon-box featured-box icon-box-top text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-img\" style=\"width: 57px\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"90\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/03-1.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"03 1\" title=\"Về AVA Architects 20\">\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-text last-reset\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<h5>Nhiệt huyết</h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Luôn làm việc với tinh thần đam mê, sự tận tâm, và nỗ lực hết mình để đạt được mục tiêu chung của bản thân và công ty.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-915355797\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"icon-box featured-box icon-box-top text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-img\" style=\"width: 57px\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"90\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/04-1.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"04 1\" title=\"Về AVA Architects 21\">\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-text last-reset\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<h5><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Đoàn kết</span><br>\n<!-- notionvc: a1c4b58e-ed9a-4b34-a79d-e78e96001300 --></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tạo dựng môi trường làm việc thân thiện, cởi mở, mọi người cùng hỗ trợ và tôn trọng lẫn nhau để tạo nên sức mạnh tập thể.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-558581557\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"icon-box featured-box icon-box-top text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-img\" style=\"width: 57px\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"90\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/05-1.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"05 1\" title=\"Về AVA Architects 22\">\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-text last-reset\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<h5><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Tỉ mỉ &amp; Tinh tế</span><!-- notionvc: 879c65ae-d33e-4ab1-91e2-8a4410abda04 --></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tinh tế trong từng đường nét, tỉ mỉ trong từng chi tiết</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1763104584\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"icon-box featured-box icon-box-top text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-img\" style=\"width: 57px\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"90\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/06-1.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"06 1\" title=\"Về AVA Architects 23\">\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-text last-reset\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<h5><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Chuyên môn</span><!-- notionvc: 19e0954f-8ee3-4d1d-b675-50cc5ef529f6 --></h5>\n<p>Vững chuyên môn, với tinh thần học hỏi và kinh nghiệm trải qua nhiều dự án lớn.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1785417858\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"icon-box featured-box icon-box-top text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-img\" style=\"width: 57px\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"90\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/07-1.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"07 1\" title=\"Về AVA Architects 24\">\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-text last-reset\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<h5><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Chất lượng &amp; Số lượng</span><!-- notionvc: 879c65ae-d33e-4ab1-91e2-8a4410abda04 --></h5>\n<p>Đề cao chất lượng hơn số lượng. Nói không với sự dư thừa.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-621230263\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"icon-box featured-box icon-box-top text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-img\" style=\"width: 66px\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"83\" height=\"41\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Artboard-1-copy-2-2.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Artboard 1 copy 2 2\" title=\"Về AVA Architects 25\">\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-text last-reset\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<h5><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Trung thực</span><br>\n<!-- notionvc: 879c65ae-d33e-4ab1-91e2-8a4410abda04 --></h5>\n<p>Luôn thẳng thắn, minh bạch trong mọi tình huống và mối quan hệ, đảm bảo tính chính trực và tin cậy.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n\n\t<div id=\"col-1606947251\" class=\"col medium-4 small-12 large-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t<div class=\"icon-box featured-box icon-box-top text-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-img\" style=\"width: 59px\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"81\" height=\"41\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Artboard-1-copy-4.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Artboard 1 copy 4\" title=\"Về AVA Architects 35\">\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon-box-text last-reset\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n<h5><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Trân tr